---
// about-me.astro
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
  
  <!-- Subtle Background Orbs -->
  <div class="absolute -top-10 left-1/3 w-72 h-72 bg-neon-purple/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Section Top Heading (FolioX exact style) -->
  <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
    <span class="text-neon-cyan font-bold text-sm tracking-wider uppercase">
      About Me
    </span>
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mt-3 tracking-tight leading-tight">
      A Passionate Data & AI Engineer<br class="hidden sm:inline" />
      Who Loves Scalable Systems & ML
    </h2>
  </div>

  <!-- Main 2-Column Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
    
    <!-- Left Column: Photo Collage & Floating Badges (5 cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative flex justify-center">
      
      <div class="relative w-full max-w-md">
        
        <!-- Main Portrait Image -->
        <div class="relative w-4/5 sm:w-3/4 aspect-[4/5] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-cosmic-card border border-cosmic-border shadow-2xl z-10">
          <img
            src="/images/fernando-quispe-fdaniel13s.webp"
            alt="Fernando Quispe"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- Secondary Laptop/Code Accent Card (Offset bottom left) -->
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-4 sm:-left-6 w-3/5 aspect-square rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-cosmic-border bg-cosmic-900 shadow-2xl z-20 hidden sm:block">
          <img
            src="/images/projects/chaquitaclla.png"
            alt="Data Engineering & AI"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-cosmic-950/90 via-cosmic-950/40 to-transparent flex items-end p-3">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-neon-cyan font-semibold">⚡ Clean Code & Big Data</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Floating Cyan Ribbon Badge (Top Left of Collage) -->
        <div class="absolute -top-4 -left-2 sm:-left-4 z-30 w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-neon-cyan text-cosmic-950 flex items-center justify-center shadow-neon-cyan transform -rotate-6 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>

        <!-- Floating Stats Box (Bottom Right of Collage) -->
        <div class="absolute -bottom-4 right-0 sm:right-4 z-30 px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-cosmic-950/90 backdrop-blur-md border border-cosmic-border shadow-2xl flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold font-mono text-neon-cyan">
            5+
          </span>
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-300 leading-tight">
            End-to-End<br />Data Solutions
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Bio & Information Grid & Download CV (7 cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7">
      
      <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
        About Me
      </h3>

      <p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Soy <b>Ingeniero de Software</b> egresado de la Universidad Peruana de Ciencias Aplicadas (UPC), especializado en <b>Data Engineering</b>, <b>Machine Learning</b> y <b>Sistemas de IA Generativa</b>. Mi enfoque une la robustez del desarrollo de software empresarial (microservicios, clean architecture, DDD) con la construcción de pipelines de datos masivos en streaming y modelos analíticos de alto valor.
      </p>

      <!-- 2-Column Info Table Box (FolioX exact style) -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl bg-cosmic-card/70 backdrop-blur-md border border-cosmic-border mb-8 shadow-cosmic-card">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-y-4 gap-x-8 text-sm">
          
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400 block font-mono">Nombre Completo</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-white">Fernando Daniel Quispe Condori</span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400 block font-mono">Ubicación</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-white">Lima, Perú</span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400 block font-mono">Email Directo</span>
            <a href="mailto:ferndani2718@gmail.com" class="font-bold text-neon-cyan hover:underline break-all">
              ferndani2718@gmail.com
            </a>
          </div>

          <div>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400 block font-mono">Grado Académico</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-white">Ingeniería de Software (UPC)</span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400 block font-mono">Especialidad</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-white">Data & AI Specialist</span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400 block font-mono">Disponibilidad</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-0.5">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
              Disponible para proyectos & roles
            </span>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pill Button "Download CV" (FolioX exact style) -->
      <div>
        <a
          href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zpLKsT-llOvlMkJbGSawzjoeXDz0qFOf/view?usp=sharing"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full font-bold text-sm text-cosmic-950 bg-neon-cyan hover:bg-neon-cyan-hover shadow-neon-cyan transition-all transform hover:scale-105 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
        >
          Download CV
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>
